				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Holds heat for many hours with zero power — physics, not electronics.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Flip-lock lid is genuinely leakproof thrown in a bag.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;One-handed open with a thumb; the lid stays put.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Slick interior coating wipes clean and resists staining.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Zojirushi&amp;#43;SM-KHE48&amp;#43;stainless&amp;#43;mug&amp;#43;16&amp;#43;oz&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Zojirushi SM-KHE48 Vacuum Insulated Mug (16 oz)&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;passive-done-right&#34;&gt;Passive done right&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You don&amp;rsquo;t need a battery to keep coffee hot — you need excellent vacuum insulation, and Zojirushi&amp;rsquo;s is the benchmark. Fill it before a flight and it&amp;rsquo;s still hot when you land. If you&amp;rsquo;ve been let down by mugs that go lukewarm by mid-morning, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Zojirushi&amp;#43;SM-KHE48&amp;#43;stainless&amp;#43;mug&amp;#43;16&amp;#43;oz&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; class=&#34;out aff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Zojirushi SM-KHE48 Vacuum Insulated Mug (16 oz)&#34; data-cta=&#34;in-content&#34;&gt;check the Amazon price&lt;svg class=&#34;out-ico&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;12&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8&#34; fill=&#